      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**What clients are served.** Every figure is counted from a release that a person recorded. Identity links are proposals until a person reviews them, and profiles rest on those proposals. A row links to its release tree or OKF page in the product service, which answers only with an API key."
      }
